	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Dabis veniam, humanissime et doctissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, si iterum ego <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>rudis et iners tua sancta studia laboresque pios interturbaro.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quod enim facio <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>non tam mea quam fratrum, tum<note type="margin">a.R.: tam?</note> piorum aliquot, imo veritatis Christi adserendę caussa <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>facio.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Rogarunt adeoque per Christum obtestati sunt me fratres et aliquot pii <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ut tibi scribam precibusque a te contendam ut Christi simplicem de coena domini <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>veritatem, a <persName ref="p7024">Westphalo</persName> illo pastore <placeName ref="l204">Hamburgo</placeName> obfuscatam vel potius oppugnatam, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tu responso brevi ex scripturis sacris perspicuo et firmo propugnare vel <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>propugnatam illustrare adserereque velis, ut dei gratia potes.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName> enim script<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>um nullum ad nos pervenit, quem audio se huic <persName ref="p7024">Westphalo</persName> opposuisse.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sunt <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>qui silentium vestrum desertionem causse vel turpem fugam interpretantur, qui tamen <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>causse favere videri volunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Reliqui theologi, vel potius <foreign xml:lang="el">κρεολόγοι</foreign> triumphant <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>inter suos.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Esto, liceat illis iubilare, adeoque ante victoriam <foreign xml:lang="el">ἐγκωμιάζειν</foreign><note type="margin">a.R.: ...</note>, sed <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ne fiat in iniuriam seu imminutionem simplicis Christi veritatis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Queso, mi hu<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>manissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, que tua est pia eruditio et sancta prudentia, de re<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mediis cogita.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quare<note type="margin">a.R.: Que et</note> pro tua fide dexteritate et prudentia fideliter et fortiter <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>adpone, ne carnalis hic tumor periculose recrudescens in pernitiem corporis Chri<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sti, hoc est eius sancte ecclesie pergat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Unum addam, si nescis: Aeditus est supe<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>rioribus diebus libellus alius cuius titulum ad me perscripsit diaconus ecclesię <placeName ref="l907">Can<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>pidonensis</placeName> talem: Collectanea sententiarum d. <persName>Aurelii</persName> Augustini episcopi <placeName>Hipponensis</placeName> de coena domin<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>i.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Addita est confutatio vindicans a corruptelis plerosque locos quos pro <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>se ex <persName ref="p18700">Augustino</persName> falso citant sacramentarii, per m. <persName ref="p7024">Ioachimum Westphalum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l410">Ratispo<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ne</placeName> ex officina <persName>Iohannis Carbonis</persName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Anno etc. 55.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Priorem libellum huius <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><persName ref="p7024">Westphali</persName> in linguam germanam versum studiose suis commendant clamatores [c<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>arn]ales, quem et in canonem, ni fallor, consecrabunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Hec, doctissime <persName ref="p495">Bullinge<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>re</persName>, tibi subindicare volui ut dispicias caveasque ne quid detrimenti verit<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>as Christi simplex, tum offendiculi Christi ecclesia accipiat.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, optime et <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>in Christo observande <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, et meam infantiam vel inpudentiam boni consule.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Ex <placeName ref="l320">Mem[m]inga</placeName> pridie nonarum martii anno a nato servatore Christo 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>T[uae] humanitati <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>deditissimus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p330">Bartholomaeus Bertlinus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ecclesie Christi ibidem mini<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ster.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Heinricho B<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ullingero</persName> fidelissimo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurine</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>antistiti, domino et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>amico suo in Christo <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>observando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürch</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
